  "writing_rules": [
    "A core is a real persistent person identity, never anonymous aggregate headcount.",
    "For bounded personal rosters, profiles may hold each person's stable lightweight capability and progression; cohort summaries are derived organization views, never character authority.",
    "Changing cohort membership, cohort statistics, promotion or exactification must preserve the same person and must never reroll an established individual profile.",
    "Age is derived from the stable birth anchor at read time rather than periodically persisted in profiles.",
    "Identity cues constrain characterization but grant no capability, knowledge, relationship, authority, equipment or outcome.",
    "component_refs remain for genuinely separate individual components; do not duplicate profile authority in another writable owner."
  ]
